      "end_timestamp": "00:41",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "so, yeah. One week, I'd say. Um, I've also had loose motions, since last Tuesday. With loose motions, I'd give it a three, out of ten. I notice it more with drinking milk and eating. Only fasting, and it's not much",
